# Workspace Environment & Operating Rules
- Platform: Cross-platform POSIX (Linux / macOS)
- Stack: Python >= 3.10, FastMCP, SQLite FTS5, Pytest
- Standard Directories: ~/.agents/ (skills, state, memories)
§
- Always verify changes with `pytest tests/ -v` before committing or finalizing code changes.
§
- FastMCP tool signatures must remain backward-compatible and support standard error handling schemas.
§
- Agent self-evolution must never overwrite user-owned or pinned procedural skills.
